OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen: Trees uprooted, zoo
OL,4,Aclosed and events cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrees have been uprooted and events
OL,7,Fcancelled as Storm Austen sweeps across
OL,8,Fthe North West.
OL,10,FResidents said they were "shocked"
OL,11,Fafter a tree came down on Garstang Road
OL,12,Fin Poulton-le-Fylde, Lancashire.
OL,14,FChester Zoo has closed amid safety
OL,15,Fconcerns, while a popular Halloween
OL,16,Ffundraiser in Liverpool has been
OL,17,Fcancelled.
OL,19,FMarkets in Macclesfield and Salford
OL,20,Fhave also fallen foul of the weather.
